  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you or a creature you can see within 30 feet of you fails an ability check or a saving throw, you can take a Reaction to add a bonus to the roll equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of +1), which can make it succeed. You can take this Reaction a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of once), and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
